<title>CANADA: Reserve Royalty sets C$17.5 mil placement.</title>
<headline>Reserve Royalty sets C$17.5 mil placement.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Royal Reserve Corporation said on Friday it agreed, subject to regulatory approvals, to a private placement of 10 million special warrants at C$1.75 each.</p>
<p>The financing, on a best efforts agency basis with Midland Walwyn Capital Inc and Newcrest Capital Inc, is expected to close on or about November 22, 1996, Royal Reserve said.     --</p>
<p>Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
